  "narrative": {
    "text": "Diagram titled \"Agent + Skills + Virtual Machine\", in two panels. Left, \"Agent configuration\": a core system prompt, a row of equipped Skills (bigquery, docx, nda-review, pdf, pptx, xlsx and others), and three equipped MCP servers which arrow down to remote MCP servers elsewhere on the internet. Right, \"Agent virtual machine\": Bash, Python and Nodejs above a file system holding one directory per skill — skills/bigquery/ with SKILL.md, datasources.md and rules.md; skills/docx/ with SKILL.md and an ooxml/ subtree; skills/nda-review/; skills/pdf/ with SKILL.md, forms.md, reference.md and extract_fields.py. A labelled arrow between the panels reads \"use computer\", and a note explains that the contents of Skill directories live in the agent computer's file system.",
